What are Automotive Press-fit Pins?
Automotive press-fit pins are precision-engineered fasteners critical for creating secure mechanical and electrical connections in vehicle assembly without requiring soldering or welding. These components are typically manufactured from durable materials like phosphor bronze or steel alloys, designed to withstand high vibration and thermal stress conditions common in automotive applications. Their primary function is to ensure reliable conductivity and mechanical stability in critical vehicle systems ranging from engine components to advanced electrical systems.
